# LED stagger, on the configsettings page of the instr selector.
# A .ui entry is not run as a program: Nebulae itself handles it (ui.py,
# mode = the name after the number, here "led_stagger").
# Speed click on it: on/off, and back to the instrument. On (default): the
# LED PWM channels switch on at different moments of the PWM cycle, so there
# is no big current step all at once (heard as a tone); the brightness looks
# the same. Saved (configsettings.py).
# Slot LED bright = on (nebulae-status).
